00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.560
September, 1588 - Settsu Province - Osaka Castle

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.930
These short-sleeved kimono are too plain for me.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:56.090
Bring me those fancy foreign clothes, Uncle.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.790
But those are...

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.610
I'm sure you heard from the doctor already.

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:09.550
You should know the position I'm in right now.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:17.650
I understand, Madam Chacha.

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:20.860
Anarchy in Japan

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:22.800
Really!?

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:29.330
There is no mistake. Your concubine, Madam Chacha, is pregnant.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.390
Seems like I still got the goods.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:44.280
With the right woman, even I can prove my manliness.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:49.130
I finally have a successor!

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:53.090
Bring out my carriage! I'm going to see Chacha!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:59.030
But you have a meeting with Rikyū today about welcoming Lord Shimazu.

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:10.490
I've prepared the tea ceremony with Lord Shimazu.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:11.850
Thank you very much.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.280
One more thing.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:31.450
I would like you to relieve me of my position after this ceremony.

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:47.810
You will not have to listen to me anymore. I'm sure things will get much quieter.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.520
No.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.750
You forced my two brothers to follow the path of Asura and now you want to escape all by yourself?

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:26.450
Isn't this just too perfect for you?

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:47.960
As expected of the number one calligrapher in the world, Ukishima Kidō.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:51.670
What heavy yet powerful strokes.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.730
But Master Rikyū.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.690
Isn't this one of the Chief Advisor's treasures?

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:05.540
The Chief Advisor wanted me to change the wall decoration.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:15.460
Thank you all for coming to this tea ceremony in rememberance of the great monk Kokei.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:19.870
Master Kokei should have arrived in Hakata.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:26.180
He was forced to move to Kyushu just because he disagreed with the construction of the temple.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:30.180
Things have gotten hard for the monks.

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:38.200
Master Kokei gave me the name Rikyū.

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:43.270
I want to thank him by using the highest quality tools.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:48.550
But if the Chief Advisor hears about you using his treasured calligraphy here...

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.430
You may be...

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:56.570
I would not mind if this led to my downfall.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:02.550
I'm not trying to destroy myself.

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:08.370
I already asked Chief Advisor for a favor.

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:15.190
I can finally breathe a sigh of relief.

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:37.190
Master Rikyū, have you come to accept your fate?

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:41.660
October, 1588 - Kyoto - Saihō Temple

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.940
We should start boosting our food provisions.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.210
Are you preparing for war?

00:06:55.620 --> 00:07:00.080
Due to Lord Tokugawa's influence, Hōjō's younger brother is coming to the capital.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:06.070
But if Ujinao himself refuses to relent,

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:09.430
a war may break out with Toyotomi.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.620
I understand.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:24.740
Hehe, this is quite nice.

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:28.180
The oldest garden in Japan.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:34.230
The rocks give the impression of just ending up where they are. How amazing.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:36.870
That carp stone, too.

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:42.870
There is no water here, but the shape of the rock invokes the image of carps swimming in water.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:46.400
I haven't had this feeling of yearning in a while.

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:49.840
If Kyoto gets invoved in a war,

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:53.780
I will make sure to save that stone.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:59.000
My residence, compared to that is just...

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.140
The fakery embarrasses me so much.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.820
I already went too far before I realized it.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.180
What are you doing, Master Tōhaku!?

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:18.010
Who said you can draw this!?

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:21.390
If you do this again, then you won't ever set foot in this temple again!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.170
Please let me continue my painting!

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:27.140
I will make you a worthy door!

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.000
Let him keep going.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:33.040
Lord Oribe!

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:37.480
If you don't like it, then I'll take it.

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:45.290
Thank you very much!

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:51.080
Painting without permission. Are you still having monetary problems?

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:53.290
I want to leave results...

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:58.080
My name spread far and wide thanks to you,

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:05.790
but the Kanō school used my lack of experience to take away all of my customers.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.510
They called you a rookie?

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:10.930
What's so funny?

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.160
The Moon-meeting Bridge?

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:16.700
That's right.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:24.320
I heard that this bridge at Saihō Temple was magnificent before it got destroyed during the war.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:32.690
What's the matter?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.260
It's nothing. Keep on painting.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:42.440
This is bad.

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:45.370
You idiot!

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:50.320
Getting involved with this man is a bad idea.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:54.970
I'm glad he is a customer, but I don't want to get killed over this.

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.730
I should refuse his request.

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:03.810
Uh...

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.500
Lord Oribe.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:45.370
Seems like my libido is awakened more by tea tools than a rock.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:51.500
I guess in order to get what I truly want, I'll have to make it myself.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:55.880
May, 1589 - Kyoto - Jurakudai

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:04.420
Lord Hosokawa Tadaoki!

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:08.440
The Chief Advisor is giving you 1,500 gold and silver pieces!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:12.460
Thank you from the bottom of my heart!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:15.490
Lord Furuta Oribe Shigenari!

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:18.880
The Chief Advisor is giving you 500 gold and silver pieces!

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:25.530
What's the matter, Sasuke?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.590
You have given me a huge reward.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:33.000
I can finally breathe a sigh of relief.

00:11:42.290 --> 00:11:45.180
This is the legendary gold coin.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:51.220
That is made with top-quality gold and it is the highest-denomination coin.

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:55.180
But he paid 300 daimyo with these coins.

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:58.260
Seems like Madam Chacha's stomach is getting bigger every day.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:02.500
Pair that up with taking control of many mines across the country and the Chief Advisor is a happy man.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.670
You are finding it hard not to crack a smile, too.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:10.540
I can finally pay back my debts now.

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:12.950
Oh yeah.

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:15.910
I heard Master invited you to a tea ceremony?

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.550
I keep trying to avoid him...

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:31.520
But he's inviting you to a personal ceremony even in these busy times.

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:33.630
You should feel honored.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:39.730
Even if you get scolded, that is something I'm jealous of.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:47.580
It's quite sad to get lectured at such an old age.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:51.280
May, 1589 - Kyoto - Hōkō Temple

00:12:56.700 --> 00:13:01.940
The construction is going well thanks to Lord Ueda directing the progress.

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:05.100
I'm just doing what I'm told to do.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:10.830
The Chief Advisor wants to place his Golden Buddha here at Hōkō Temple.

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:14.020
But you are the top proponent of simplicity, Master Rikyū.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:17.010
I'm sure this is painful for you.

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:25.920
I think designing a tea room is much more interesting than building a giant Buddha.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:34.280
Please tell the central planner Maeda Toshinaga that I'm looking forward to the results.

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:38.730
I will do what I can do.

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:42.650
Laugh and run with it, I guess?

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:01.160
It's been a year and half since that tea ceremony.

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:06.020
My training has not progressed at all.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:08.190
In any case,

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:12.300
I was just an immature dabbler in simplicity.

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:18.360
I should just grit my teeth and accept the scolding from Master.

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.390
What's going on here?

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.350
This is quite bright, in Master's terms.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.880
Did he increase the size of the windows?

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:09.430
An Imayaki tea bowl!?

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:13.300
Not a black one!? Why!?

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.840
The tea bowl disappeared!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.780
The tea bowl changed into the same color as my skin!

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:29.540
The ceremony is swimming into thin air!

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:34.090
Is that where the light is coming from!?

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:38.710
Compared to a dark room with a black tea bowl, this is just unbelievable!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:43.920
The sunlight gives off the illusion of a disappearing existence!

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:53.700
This red tea bowl came before the black one.

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:59.620
That's right. This was from the time when I was just an aesthete on simplicity.

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:05.070
Master Hechikan was right.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:09.880
I've been swallowed by the hellfire.

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:15.390
I was obsessed with the beauty of black and became the tea master Rikyū.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:20.650
I kept pushing humanity to the limits of piety.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:25.980
But I suddenly realized after so long.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:34.470
Simplicity should be something fun.

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:44.170
Maybe I was drawn in by how fun it was.

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:48.820
I am learning valuable lessons from the past.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:55.850
The first thing that popped up inside my mind was you, Lord Furuori.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:07.340
I am still a rookie myself.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.180
I hereby apologize to you.

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:32.680
Please raise your head.

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:37.310
Perhaps you can give me something in exchange.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:41.450
Like that tea scoop?

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:48.610
Or perhaps I should hold a tea ceremony for you in the future, Master Rikyū.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:53.330
I'm not Rikyū now.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:57.350
I'm just Tanaka Yoshirō.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:17.170
Have you realized it, too?

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:26.060
I've always thought a vase made of wisteria does not require a laminated base.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:35.070
I am like your disciple in such matters, Lord Furuori.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:39.150
No, I was able to come this far because of your teachings.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:50.830
I gave that tea pot to him.

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:54.180
I thought that crack on the lid was very interesting.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.140
I pointed the crack at myself so the guest does not see the imperfection.

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:01.580
But he points the crack straight at me instead.

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:24.890
Has this man reached his utmost limit already?

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:35.140
I've decided not to beat myself up anymore ever since you performed a tea ceromony for me.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:39.920
If even someone like you is imperfect, like this cover,

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.900
then we are all full of imperfections.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:49.160
Perhaps that's interesting in its own right?

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:53.560
More than enough is too much.

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:57.520
That is a true statement.

00:19:57.910 --> 00:20:06.070
But along the way we find amusement in such things.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:09.250
If one can find peace among such interests,

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:13.260
that may be the ultimate goal for the true aesthete.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.870
That's hard.

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:21.220
To say that such a small cover is quite interesting.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:26.790
When you go overboard, like you did with your residence,

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:30.620
you cause others to think it was all done on purpose.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:32.880
I guess that was how it looked.

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.060
That's right.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:42.120
I have to find a way to take it all back.

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:47.060
We have both examined this cover.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:49.920
I'm sure there will be many people yearning for it.

00:20:56.180 --> 00:21:00.130
I wonder how much we can sell these for, for a tea ceremony?

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:22.400
That is not for a warrior like you to decide.

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:27.370
Let me see how high I can push the price.

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:30.960
One for 100 kan?

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:34.440
At the very least, you want 300.

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:35.510
How about 500?

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:40.010
Laugh and run with it, I guess?

00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:50.770
I want to kiss my lovely Ochi!

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:55.140
I can't wait to see the drooling face of my heir!

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:00.660
What's the matter?

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:07.680
Listen to our dear leader's monkey screeches!

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:19.210
Such graffiti have been popping up more and more recently.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:23.640
I've already punished the guards...

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:26.530
Seems like you didn't punish them enough.

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:30.730
Graffiti was rampant during the Ōnin era.

00:22:31.850 --> 00:22:35.480
Now is an important time for the unification of this land.

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:42.620
Even a silly joke like this can cause massive havoc.

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.360
You must catch the perpetrator.

00:22:47.320 --> 00:22:49.310
Cut off his ears and nose.

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:52.620
Then cut off his head and hang it over the river.

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:57.780
Come on, let's head to Chacha's place.

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:06.340
Everytime I　

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:06.340
Anata no mune

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:08.730
feel your heart

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:08.730
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:14.820
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:14.820
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:21.000
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:21.000
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.850 --> 00:23:27.160
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.850 --> 00:23:27.160
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:33.250
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:33.250
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:37.130
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:37.130
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.360 --> 00:23:40.710
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.360 --> 00:23:40.710
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:46.580
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:46.580
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:49.580
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:49.580
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.660 --> 00:23:52.190
Without each other.

00:23:49.660 --> 00:23:52.190
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:53.150
You should

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:53.150
Soshite

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:58.650
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:58.650
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.760 --> 00:24:02.440
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.760 --> 00:24:02.440
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:08.150
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:08.150
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.230 --> 00:24:14.640
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.230 --> 00:24:14.640
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.700 --> 00:24:20.440
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.700 --> 00:24:20.440
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.920 --> 00:24:26.420
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.920 --> 00:24:26.420
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:35.010 --> 00:24:36.530
He got me!

00:24:39.490 --> 00:24:41.160
What? A killing intent!?

00:24:47.110 --> 00:24:48.750
How beautiful.

00:24:49.740 --> 00:24:52.220
Furuta Oribe and Fires.

00:24:53.280 --> 00:24:54.640
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.260 --> 00:24:57.980
That is the question.

00:24:56.390 --> 00:24:59.680
Furuta Oribe and Fires
